<title>USA: United Payor sets $5 mln repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>United Payor sets $5 mln repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Payors &amp; United Providers Inc on Tuesday said it approved a program to repurchase up to $5 million of its stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a news release it will make the purchases on the open market.</p>
<p>Shares of United Payors, an intermediary between health-care payors and providers, closed down 3/4 at 12-1/4.</p>
</text>
